Number eight, you will want to make sure that you have timely reviews now this is a key thing when I talk to project teams about doing a really good material procurement effort and to have a procurement log, or to have procurement in the schedule, I always talk about our ability to recover if we go late or if something ends up being delayed and what I mean by that is if you track the required on job day, the material inventory buffer, the lead time, the approval time how long it takes to review all the way back to the time, when the trade partner actually creates the submittal,\",\"url\":\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=mnfOIj-CYY4\",\"provider\":\"youtube.com\",\"topicId\":\"c97dae88-a72f-4e01-9501-223dc78791ac\",\"roleIds\":[\"bba5a9f5-d209-4752-8806-ee53e58c1c9c\"],\"type\":\"video\",\"level\":\"deep-dive\",\"track\":\"pm\",\"status\":\"review\",\"embed\":{\"canEmbed\":true,\"provider\":\"youtube\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/mnfOIj-CYY4\"}},\"details\":[\"Procurement & the Procurement Log\",\"pm\",\"Project Manager\"],\"showStatus\":false,\"showEmbed\":false,\"actions\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"459c4c55-97c9-43f2-a570-c4e96bd71daa\",\"decision\":\"archive\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"459c4c55-97c9-43f2-a570-c4e96bd71daa\",\"decision\":\"publish\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"8baae598-57bc-4ad3-b514-5131558ffe94\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"8baae598-57bc-4ad3-b514-5131558ffe94\",\"title\":\"Construction Procurement Management - What is it?\",\"description\":\"# Construction Procurement Management - What is it? ## Tim Fairley 42700 subscribers 221 likes ### Description 17630 views Posted: 18 Aug 2021 Free procurement course and resources: Join ContractorOS & leverage AI in your construction business: Get started with Operum (AI-Enhanced Estimating Software): Work with me: Connect with me on LinkedIn: Construction Procurement Management is the process of acquiring the necessary goods and services to deliver a project. This short video is an extract of our course on construction procurement management which teaches the basics of how to engage suppliers and sub-contractors on construction projects. [...] is an extract of our course on construction pr\",\"url\":\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=bnRsSOSmzKc\",\"provider\":\"youtube.com\",\"topicId\":\"c97dae88-a72f-4e01-9501-223dc78791ac\",\"roleIds\":[\"bba5a9f5-d209-4752-8806-ee53e58c1c9c\"],\"type\":\"video\",\"level\":\"deep-dive\",\"track\":\"pm\",\"status\":\"review\",\"embed\":{\"canEmbed\":true,\"provider\":\"youtube\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/bnRsSOSmzKc\"}},\"details\":[\"Procurement & the Procurement Log\",\"pm\",\"Project Manager\"],\"showStatus\":false,\"showEmbed\":false,\"actions\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"8baae598-57bc-4ad3-b514-5131558ffe94\",\"decision\":\"archive\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"8baae598-57bc-4ad3-b514-5131558ffe94\",\"decision\":\"publish\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"1ad37217-dbda-4888-a216-26da7082cfe1\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"1ad37217-dbda-4888-a216-26da7082cfe1\",\"title\":\"Whatâ€™s The Best Way To Start Understanding And Managing The Daily Schedule And Look-Ahead Planning?\",\"description\":\"to workers. So as a super, a PM, or an assistant in any of those roles, what we have to do is make sure that this format and any planning that we've done get out to the workers. And what I recommend you doing, and I'll just draw workers like this, they're super important, but there's too many of them to get give individual stick figures, but what you want to do is basically orient the team to the day plan. So you'll cover things like, what's going on for today? What's the weather? Where are the inspections happening? When are the material deliveries, you know, so on and so forth. Make this information in this slice and the problem solving that you've done from your visuals, communicate that\",\"url\":\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=xXKJeuWvngc\",\"provider\":\"youtube.com\",\"topicId\":\"a17aa3c8-ab23-4460-a97d-64affe6890cf\",\"roleIds\":[\"def9fa36-a9a8-46fd-adca-1a7544bda153\"],\"type\":\"video\",\"level\":\"deep-dive\",\"track\":\"field\",\"status\":\"review\",\"embed\":{\"canEmbed\":true,\"provider\":\"youtube\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xXKJeuWvngc\"}},\"details\":[\"Look-Aheads & Pull Planning\",\"field\",\"Assistant Superintendent\"],\"showStatus\":false,\"showEmbed\":false,\"actions\":\"$L2e\"}],\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\",\"$L3e\",\"$L3f\",\"$L40\",\"$L41\",\"$L42\",\"$L43\",\"$L44\",\"$L45\",\"$L46\",\"$L47\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"1ad37217-dbda-4888-a216-26da7082cfe1\",\"decision\":\"archive\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"1ad37217-dbda-4888-a216-26da7082cfe1\",\"decision\":\"publish\"}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"8b3e2279-7fcd-4c50-8d15-5e9d507bde94\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"8b3e2279-7fcd-4c50-8d15-5e9d507bde94\",\"title\":\"Construction Scheduling: Complete Step-by-Step Guide\",\"description\":\"to factor in resourcing across different tasks. Then to manage the schedule during the construction phase, you need to communicate and constantly refine the plan. You need to track progress against the baseline correctly. You need to predict issues before they become problems and you need to adjust for delays, clashes, and resourcing issues. So, in this video, we're going to teach you exactly how to do that. We're going to teach you construction project scheduling. We'll cover what is scheduling and how it's actually used on projects, why scheduling matters, and how it makes contractors more money, the core scheduling concepts. Then we're going to cover in detail the core stages of construct\",\"url\":\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=TKL24rKW_IU\",\"provider\":\"youtube.com\",\"topicId\":\"5bd9694b-b42e-4dbb-8aff-0684a41acae9\",\"roleIds\":[\"bba5a9f5-d209-4752-8806-ee53e58c1c9c\"],\"type\":\"video\",\"level\":\"deep-dive\",\"track\":\"pm\",\"status\":\"review\",\"embed\":{\"canEmbed\":true,\"provider\":\"youtube\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/TKL24rKW_IU\"}},\"details\":[\"Project Scheduling\",\"pm\",\"Project Manager\"],\"showStatus\":false,\"showEmbed\":false,\"actions\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"8b3e2279-7fcd-4c50-8d15-5e9d507bde94\",\"decision\":\"archive\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"8b3e2279-7fcd-4c50-8d15-5e9d507bde94\",\"decision\":\"publish\"}]]}]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"dcd8ff3b-d45a-4aab-8945-7aadd566fcdb\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"dcd8ff3b-d45a-4aab-8945-7aadd566fcdb\",\"title\":\"RFI Meaning in Construction: The Complete Guide\",\"description\":\"Complete guide to the RFI process, routing, and response timelines\",\"url\":\"https://academy2.youngarchitect.com/what-is-an-rfi-construction/\",\"provider\":\"Young Architect Academy\",\"topicId\":\"2588c976-8d37-47dd-8c22-922169af90ce\",\"roleIds\":[\"1115314b-69ca-4bf3-a0b5-a35fef35fb41\",\"f3f7619a-46a2-48c9-bab1-8cbb6e66de94\",\"bba5a9f5-d209-4752-8806-ee53e58c1c9c\"],\"type\":\"doc\",\"level\":\"deep-dive\",\"track\":\"pm\",\"status\":\"review\",\"embed\":\"$undefined\"},\"details\":[\"RFIs â€” Requests for Information\",\"pm\",\"Project Engineer, Assistant Project Manager, Project Manager\"],\"showStatus\":false,\"showEmbed\":false,\"actions\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"dcd8ff3b-d45a-4aab-8945-7aadd566fcdb\",\"decision\":\"archive\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"resourceId\":\"dcd8ff3b-d45a-4aab-8945-7aadd566fcdb\",\"dec